<blockquote>
<p>Subject remained unconscious for 3 days, and spontaneously suffered a heart attack. It is assumed that the subject died while at the location, killing them in real life.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'd just like to note that the whole &quot;if you die in your dreams you die in real life&quot; thing is an old wives' tale with no basis in reality and makes no sense if you think about it, because there's no way anyone could possibly know what someone was dreaming about if they died in their sleep.</p>
